$
  [ ] Syslog               Review ~ not forwarding$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Logger               rsyslog$
   -  Server               None$
   -  hardn.yml            No server$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          No server in hardn.yml$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]: $
